"\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#content\">跳至正文</a>\n<div class=\"shell\">\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#start\"><img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"NocoBase\"><span class=\"version\">3</span><span class=\"doc-label\">文档</span></a>\n    <div class=\"toplinks\"><a href=\"/zh-CN/studio\">Studio</a><span class=\"language\">简体中文</span><a href=\"https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/tree/v3-develop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub ↗</a><a href=\"https://www.nocobase.com/cn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">官网 ↗</a></div>\n  </header>\n  <main id=\"content\">\n    <section id=\"start\" class=\"quick\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n      <div class=\"quickhead\"><div><div class=\"section-label\"><b>NocoBase 3</b><i></i><span>快速开始</span></div><h1 id=\"title\">从一句话，开始你的应用。</h1><p class=\"lede\">先装好 Skills，接下来用对话创建应用、开发功能，实时预览效果。</p><a class=\"comparison-entry\" href=\"/zh-CN/nocobase-2-vs-3\">了解 NocoBase 2 与 3 的区别 →</a></div><span class=\"requirements\">本地环境：Node.js 24+ · pnpm 11<br>支持 Skills 的 Coding Agent，如 Claude Code、Codex</span></div>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"stepheading\"><span class=\"number\">01</span><h3>安装 Skills</h3></div>\n          <p>在本地终端安装，让 Agent 知道如何创建和开发 NocoBase 3 应用。</p>\n          <div class=\"codebox\"><div class=\"codebar\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"4 17 10 11 4 5\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"19\"></line></svg>本地终端</span><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"install\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>复制</button></div><pre id=\"install\">npx skills@latest add nocobase/skills-v3 --skill '*' -g</pre></div>\n          <div class=\"step-details\"><p>按提示选择你使用的 Agent，安装后<strong>新开一个会话</strong>加载 Skills。</p><details><summary>安装了什么？以后怎么更新？</summary><p>从 NocoBase 3 的独立 Skills 仓库全局安装 Skills；以后再次执行同一命令即可更新。</p><p>应用创建后，会自带与安装版本配套的 Skills。</p></details></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"stepheading\"><span class=\"number\">02</span><h3>创建并启动应用</h3></div>\n          <p>准备一个空目录，在其中打开 Agent，告诉它你想创建应用。</p>\n          <div class=\"codebox\"><div class=\"codebar\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M13 8H7\"></path><path d=\"M17 12H7\"></path></svg>发送给 Agent</span><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"create\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>复制提示词</button></div><div class=\"prompttext\" id=\"create\">帮我创建一个 NocoBase 3 App，启动本地开发环境，并告诉我访问地址和登录方式。</div></div>\n          <div class=\"step-details\"><p>Agent 会安装依赖、配置应用并启动。初次体验可使用 SQLite；需要其他数据库时直接告诉它。</p><p>应用启动后，在<strong>应用目录</strong>继续告诉 Agent 你想开发什么。</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"intro conversation\" id=\"agent\" aria-labelledby=\"agent-title\">\n      <div class=\"conversation-intro\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>和 Agent 一起开发</div><h2 id=\"agent-title\">从第一个想法，到可用的业务功能</h2><p class=\"description\">在应用目录告诉 Agent 你的业务需求。一起讨论方案、制定计划、编写代码，随时打开本地预览，再根据试用结果继续调整。</p>\n        <div class=\"workflow\">\n          <div><span class=\"number\">1</span><div>按你的方式推进<small>先聊设计、先列计划，或者直接动手，都可以。</small></div></div>\n          <div><span class=\"number\">2</span><div>边看边改<small>在本地实时预览，试用后继续提出调整。</small></div></div>\n          <div><span class=\"number\">3</span><div>持续完善<small>继续增加业务功能，按需使用下方的应用能力。</small></div></div>\n        </div><p class=\"conversation-note\">下面是一段可能的对话。每次说出当前想做的事，让 Agent 结合项目接着处理。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"conversation-example\">\n        <figure class=\"sample conversation-sample\" style=\"margin:0\"><figcaption class=\"codebar\"><span>你与 Agent 的连续对话</span><span>从需求描述到本地预览</span></figcaption>\n          <ol class=\"chat-flow\">\n            <li><span class=\"chat-index\">01</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">描述业务</span><p>我要开发一个采购管理系统，管理供应商、采购订单和审批。</p></div></li>\n            <li><span class=\"chat-index\">02</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">讨论方案和计划</span><p>先聊一下设计方案，再列个实施计划。过程中有新想法，我们随时调整。</p></div></li>\n            <li><span class=\"chat-index\">03</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">实现并预览</span><p>先把订单管理做出来，启动本地预览，我看看效果。</p></div></li>\n            <li><span class=\"chat-index\">04</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">持续改进</span><p>订单列表加上状态筛选，审批完成后通知申请人。</p></div></li>\n          </ol>\n          <footer>将业务名称和功能需求换成自己的描述，继续对话完善应用。</footer>\n        </figure>\n        <div class=\"conversation-deployment\">\n          <p>应用准备上线时，可通过 PM2 或 Docker 部署到自己的服务器。</p>\n          <a href=\"/zh-CN/deployment\">查看部署指南 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"capabilities\" aria-labelledby=\"cap-title\"><div class=\"capheader\"><div><div class=\"section-label\"><b>应用能力</b><i></i><span>按需使用</span></div><h2 id=\"cap-title\">基础能力就绪，专注你的业务。</h2><p>Agent 会直接使用这些能力，不必从零开发。打开任意一项，选择场景，修改并复制提示词。</p></div><div class=\"search-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input class=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索能力…\" aria-label=\"搜索能力\"></div></div><div class=\"cards\" id=\"cards\"><a class=\"card ui-library-card\" id=\"ui-library\" href=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-search=\"UI Library 界面示例 组件 interface components examples\"><span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z\"></path></svg></span><h3>UI Library</h3><p>界面组件与交互示例，为 Agent 构建业务页面提供参考。</p><span class=\"cardfoot\">查看界面示例<span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></span></a></div><p class=\"empty\" hidden>没有找到匹配的能力，请试试其他关键词。</p></section>\n    \n<footer class=\"end\"><span>NocoBase 3 · 开发文档</span><span>开源 · 私有部署 · 自选模型与 Agent</span></footer>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<dialog id=\"prompt-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"dialog-description\">\n  <header class=\"prompt-header\"><span class=\"icon\" id=\"dialog-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h2 id=\"dialog-title\"></h2><p id=\"dialog-description\"></p></div><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"关闭弹窗\">×</button></header>\n  <div class=\"prompt-body\"><div class=\"prompt-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"选择提示词场景\"></div><div id=\"prompt-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\"><textarea aria-label=\"提示词\" id=\"prompt-editor\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></div><p class=\"prompt-hint\">复制前可以按自己的业务修改提示词。关闭弹窗后，修改不会保留。</p></div>\n  <footer class=\"prompt-footer\"><button id=\"reset-prompt\" class=\"reset-button\" disabled><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11a9 9 0 1 1 3 7M3 4v7h7\"/></svg>恢复默认</button><div class=\"prompt-actions\"><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"close-prompt\">关闭</button><button class=\"primary\" id=\"copy-prompt\">复制</button></div></footer>\n</dialog>\n<div class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n"
